abstract: >-
  An Agent Skill for editing and pre-submission auditing of scientific
  manuscripts in Russian and English. It verifies claims against sources and
  sources against reality, runs four gates (sources, internal facts,
  provenance and conflicts of interest, falsifiability), scores the text on a
  venue-calibrated rubric and returns an editorial recommendation. Bundled
  standard-library tools: a GOST-aware formatting linter and a version diff
  for reviewing edits.
keywords:
  - scientific editing
  - peer review
  - research integrity
  - agent skill
  - GOST
  - bilingual
